              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi lapho nifika ezweni futhi nitshale zonke izinhlobo zemithi ukuba zidliwe, kumelwe nibheke izithelo zayo njengezingasokile; iminyaka emithathu liyakuba ngokungasoki kini; ingadliwa.",
